in simulator: Purchase.\nWhy: This tells the training campaign what counts as the result.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (not yet uploaded to Drive): Module_05_Build_the_Ad_Campaign/M05_Build_the_Ad_Campaign.pptx\nLMS ADMIN ACTION: Upload this module deck separately before learner publication.","duration":"20","lesson_id":"895680b2-9372-47df-b8bb-2b17484fba40","module_id":"5e0d6e1b-e6fa-450d-93da-45fb48e4bcb7","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:33.813185+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:33.813185+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"Inspect Day 1 arrival and service evidence","content":"WORKPLACE: Aarohan Auto Components - fictional employee onboarding simulation. MODULE FILES: Read the file linked in this lesson. Keep the original source file unchanged.\nDO: Use module source to check actual joining date, identity status, HRIS updates, equipment and manager acknowledgement.\n CHECK: Verify candidate ID, evidence, status and responsible owner. Do not mark pending items complete.","duration":"35","lesson_id":"89617c49-02df-420c-945d-c28e4303b204","module_id":"022301cb-819a-4972-beb0-ed07f30a1312","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:05.546177+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:05.546177+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Remove Ananya’s viewer access","content":"WHAT WE ARE DOING: Approved leaver ticket IAM-L-301: remove Ananya’s group, but keep the identity record.\nI SHOW — REFERENCE: Observe the paired reference action in the separate reference environment.\nREFERENCE ACTION / COMMAND:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe reference_show.py 21\n# REFERENCE realm only; do NOT run work.py yet.\nI TRY — EXACT REPEAT: Use the same code or clicks shown, unchanged, in your own learner lab. For Python tasks, put the complete code below into the learner work.py file. Do not repeat a state-changing account creation twice in the same realm.\nCODE / EXACT TOOL ACTION:\nfrom iam_api import connect, find_user, find_group, group_names, ROOT\ns = connect(\"IAM-L-301\")\nu = find_user(s, \"ananya.shah\")\ng = find_group(s, \"Finance-Viewers\")\nr = s.delete(f\"{ROOT}/users/{u[''id'']}/groups/{g[''id'']}\",\n             timeout=15)\nr.raise_for_status()\nprint(\"GROUPS:\", group_names(s, u[\"id\"]))\nRUN / PERFORM:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe work.py\nEXPECTED RESULT:\nGROUPS: []\nCHECK AGAINST THE ACTUAL RESULT:\nIAM-L-301 has authorized removal.\nFinance-Viewers is now absent.\nDo not delete the identity record.\nUNDERSTAND:\nRemoving group membership takes away the authorized viewer entitlement.\n\nSOURCE: Approved IAM L1 v8, source slide(s) 73–74 (Guided task 21). Module 06 (Evolve).","duration":"40","lesson_id":"8a4450d4-37cf-47c7-849d-454b47d7cf7b","module_id":"08ce89f2-829a-4f61-8004-4bb83c2c6ff7","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:13.642258+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:13.642258+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"S10 - Load eight Grama records","content":"WHAT: We are expanding our directory to eight fictional workplace records.\nDO: Expand data.js from the initial sample to eight Grama resources, preserving their fields and IDs.\nRUN / RESULT / CHECK: Exactly eight generated cards appear on the page.\nIF IT FAILS: Check the records array length and console if fewer than eight appear.\nSOURCE: Linked Module 02 PowerPoint, task S10 (original V25 teaching content).\nEVIDENCE: Grama_Learner_Evidence.xlsx > S01_S43_EXECUTION, row S10.","duration":"35","lesson_id":"8a64142d-2cb3-4e19-b9d6-77bd36d1a395","module_id":"7a584fec-8468-485f-aad3-a5fe02e103ca","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:38.337878+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:38.337878+00:00","description":null,"order_index":6},{"title":"Empower: HR Analytics","content":"MODULE 3: HR Analytics\n6E STAGE: Empower\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nBUILD THE HR POWER BI DASHBOARD\nLoad workforce, recruitment and onboarding; use Month / Period, Region and Role dimensions.\nCreate Exit Rate, OT/Employee, Engagement, Vacancies, Applications, Offer Acceptance and Joining Rate measures.\nAdd trend, regional comparison and recruitment funnel visuals.\nAdd Region / Period slicers.\n\nRESOURCE: M3_HR_Empower.pptx","duration":null,"lesson_id":"8b8574a3-3d2c-481a-b68d-518aa008d224","module_id":"8759a2fe-d783-4917-9716-d5383a2387ac","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:25.100972+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:25.100972+00:00","description":null,"order_index":6},{"title":"Number Signal: Build and Extend","content":"Predict the missing term in 2 → 4 → 6 → 8 → ?. Then add counters in the simulator to see how the numbers grow. Solve the fresh 3 → 6 → 9 → 12 → ? sequence and select the correct mathematical rule.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"8b8dc70b-bfd3-4172-8bdd-66d0cbb408b7","module_id":"7c78ebee-8cbe-4c88-9b17-7dcdd312ccc4","created_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:47.617107+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:47.617107+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Make a separate working copy and change M-03 code","content":"Use the course transfer setup/run instructions to create the M-03 working copy; do not overwrite M-02 evidence. First run the baseline to observe intended failing cases, then identify and edit the two threshold decisions for 72C/66C independently. OUTPUT: saved M-03 learner C source.","duration":"45","lesson_id":"8ceb4901-9479-497f-ad2b-6a1f2e1708ac","module_id":"d09eb39f-3151-4b13-a818-a75a632157f2","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:30.386262+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:30.386262+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Explore: Marketing and Sales Analytics","content":"MODULE 4: Marketing and Sales Analytics\n6E STAGE: Explore\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nMARKETING & SALES EXCEL FORMULAS\nConversion Rate\nConversions / Leads\nROAS\nAttributed_Revenue_INR /\nMarketing_Spend_INR\nCost per Conversion\nMarketing_Spend_INR / Conversions\nClosed Leads\nClosed Leads = Won + Lost\nSales Win Rate\nWon / Closed Leads\nCreate PivotTables by Period, Region, Channel and Lead Source.\n\nRESOURCE: M4_Marketing_and_Sales_Explore.pptx","duration":null,"lesson_id":"8e1a24aa-8696-4f7e-be80-8dc7643a23fb","module_id":"42b2abe9-d25a-4686-8887-58a6810cdd28","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:26.432419+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:26.432419+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Schedule valid channels and submit the activation plan","content":"WORKPLACE: SwaadFit Foods and GrainGlow Foods - fictional packaged snacks marketing cases. MODULE FILES: Open the complete self-paced ZIP; Module 3 presentation, source and learner workbook are inside its 01_Learner_Modules folder.\nDO: Verify revised budget, owner, timing and status in 03_Execution. Complete 04_Handover with approval request; use 06_Budget_Practice only as separate hypothetical practice.\n CHECK: Save the working record; open 90_Check_After_Attempt only after completing the task; do not invent approval, actual spending, conversion events or causal claims.","duration":"60","lesson_id":"8e293728-644d-41dd-ba0d-0041917f227c","module_id":"7f78ef5d-704e-4360-9363-d268dc2a086e","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:43.156144+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:43.156144+00:00","description":null,"order_index":6},{"title":"Calculate accounts-receivable ageing","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Foods - fictional finance workplace case. MODULE FILES: Record answers in the linked learner workbook. Use the same module source and guided deck from Drive.\nDO: Use 04_AR to calculate overdue days and outstanding balances, identify customers beyond terms and record justified collection priorities.\n CHECK: Save the source-supported output and carry unresolved items to the next task; management approvals are not implied.","duration":"55","lesson_id":"8e984605-4958-43ce-b7bf-9e0d76f0ba61","module_id":"c02814cb-fc5f-4e0c-8756-451d7d0843a4","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:58.540655+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:58.540655+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"S23 - Create the SQLite database","content":"WHAT: We are creating database tables for resources, users and sessions.\nDO: Create SQLite tables for resources, coordinator users and sessions with db.js, then inspect sqlite_master using the supplied Node command.\nRUN / RESULT / CHECK: The required SQLite tables exist in the intended DB file.\nIF IT FAILS: Use the exact inspection command; do not assume the schema exists because npm start launched.\nSOURCE: Linked Module 04 PowerPoint, task S23 (original V25 teaching content).\nEVIDENCE: Grama_Learner_Evidence.xlsx > S01_S43_EXECUTION, row S23.","duration":"75","lesson_id":"8eab09df-4411-4205-aac9-f2babad4c1ab","module_id":"8009900c-e018-4848-aab2-f1e19136e26a","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:46.301147+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:46.301147+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"Start the SwaadFit marketing work cycle","content":"WORKPLACE: SwaadFit Foods and GrainGlow Foods - fictional packaged snacks marketing cases. MODULE FILES: Open the complete self-paced ZIP; Module 1 presentation, source and learner workbook are inside its 01_Learner_Modules folder. COURSE SOURCE FOLDER: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1X0DoCDuScQp9MBbWKNV0IRa2PZCpDh9Q.\nDO: Open the integrated ZIP, then 01_Learner_Modules/SwaadFit_M1_Internship_Workplace_Visuals.pptx and SwaadFit_M1_Workbook.xlsx. Read the manager request and the five linked jobs.\n CHECK: Save the working record; open 90_Check_After_Attempt only after completing the task; do not invent approval, actual spending, conversion events or causal claims.","duration":"20","lesson_id":"8f440b41-8dcc-4117-a390-fee32b670001","module_id":"29687f58-184a-4af4-a628-043d14f5d175","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:32.385693+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:32.385693+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"SIMULATOR — First IAM Shift: Watch, Repeat and Verify","content":"SIMULATOR PRACTICE — M01 / LESSON 03 (REQUIRED)\nWHAT WE ARE DOING: Complete the simulated workplace access request before beginning technical setup.\nOPEN: Use the resource link in this lesson to download IAM_FIRST_SHIFT.html. Open the downloaded HTML locally in Chrome or Edge. The Google Drive preview is not the running simulator.\nI SHOW: Select the built-in I SHOW view. Observe the ticket, account, group, portal result and evidence changing on screen.\nI TRY: In the learner view, repeat the SAME action exactly. Keep the same employee, group and requested operation. No variation.\nRUN: Complete all 12 guided actions, from ticket check and account setup through access tests, proof preservation, approved removal and review-queue handover.\nRESULT: The learner''s screen must show the SAME saved state and allowed/denied outcomes as the reference.\nCHECK: Compare each observed result with the demonstration before proceeding.\nUNDERSTAND: Say what the action changed and why the IAM analyst needed to do it.\nCOMPLETION: Finish the 12-step simulator before opening the real Keycloak/Python lab in Module 02.\nBOUNDARY: This offline HTML is a training simulator, not a connected Keycloak system or certification test.\nSOURCE: Approved IAM L1 v8, original module 01 slides 6–13.","duration":"55","lesson_id":"8f5d2cfb-180a-4df1-8f61-3f25ab83aeed","module_id":"e3fe24fa-601b-4db2-8e4a-d03421c93044","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:01.675503+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:01.675503+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Open, assign and maintain the issue log","content":"WORKPLACE: Aarohan Auto Components - fictional employee onboarding simulation. MODULE FILES: Record answers in the linked learner workbook. Use the same module source and guided deck from Drive.\nDO: Complete 07_Issue_Log with issue, current status, owner, next action and evidence; do not close an item without proof.\n CHECK: Verify candidate ID, evidence, status and responsible owner. Do not mark pending items complete.","duration":"60","lesson_id":"90f70d01-c43e-4be4-9c5c-85fb1a514561","module_id":"fd462bb9-9a77-4355-ac64-2859a808c0f2","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:09.813569+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:09.813569+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"T30 - Choose Bengaluru adults aged 18+","content":"Work task T30: Choose Bengaluru adults aged 18+.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nOpen: Ads Manager (practice) in the shared offline simulator.\n1. Open Ads Manager > Ad sets.\n2. Enter Bengaluru and minimum age 18.\n3. Leave the maximum age unrestricted and save.\nCompleted example: Location: Bengaluru; Minimum age: 18; Maximum age: No upper limit.\nCheck in simulator: No upper limit.\nWhy: The event requires adults 18+. The manager did not approve a 45-year maximum.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (not yet uploaded to Drive): Module_05_Build_the_Ad_Campaign/M05_Build_the_Ad_Campaign.pptx\nLMS ADMIN ACTION: Upload this module deck separately before learner publication.","duration":"25","lesson_id":"921795fc-fd4b-4b45-8b3a-291179b5b7d8","module_id":"5e0d6e1b-e6fa-450d-93da-45fb48e4bcb7","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:34.955546+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:34.955546+00:00","description":null,"order_index":6},{"title":"Correct the two Motor M-02 warning rules","content":"In the assigned learner C file, repair the approved 65C CLEAR and 70C ON comparisons. Do not edit completed reference sources or change test CSV files. Save the file before running tests. OUTPUT: saved C change in assessment/assigned_firmware_host_demo.c.","duration":"50","lesson_id":"9264d591-b9f7-4b54-9221-1fd8132f1def","module_id":"384d0feb-b2bd-4611-a17a-dba0f96c9ada","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:27.830245+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:27.830245+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Submit the independent transfer manager note","content":"WORKPLACE: SwaadFit Foods and GrainGlow Foods - fictional packaged snacks marketing cases. MODULE FILES: Open the complete self-paced ZIP; GrainGlow files are inside 04_Independent_Practice. Use this ZIP source to avoid mixing versions. Read 90_Check_After_Attempt only after completing the work.\nDO: Complete 02_Manager_Note with performance, unresolved evidence, action and approval. Do not copy the earlier SwaadFit scenario or use the separate mismatched folder source.\n CHECK: Save the working record; open 90_Check_After_Attempt only after completing the task; do not invent approval, actual spending, conversion events or causal claims.","duration":"40","lesson_id":"92ba7750-0709-49c4-886c-4c41d8f55208","module_id":"a97147bf-68b1-495a-b6d6-a3553e62ad46","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:54.824224+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:54.824224+00:00","description":null,"order_index":6},{"title":"Calculate September product sales","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Foods - fictional finance workplace case. MODULE FILES: Record answers in the linked learner workbook. Use the same module source and guided deck from Drive.\nDO: Follow the worked Masala Chips row, then complete other product packs and revenue in learner workbook sheet 01_SALES. Verify the total of 12,000 packs and Rs 12,85,000.\n CHECK: Save the source-supported output and carry unresolved items to the next task; management approvals are not implied.","duration":"55","lesson_id":"935e03bd-a39b-4f49-8430-2641ba3c23e7","module_id":"256300bc-d9a5-4ac7-b553-8db9932a5b71","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:52.306289+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:52.306289+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Apply: Predict School Flag 14","content":"Observe the repeating coloured flags in the simulator. Predict the colour at position 14 and check your answer. Use the length of the repeating group to explain how you decided.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"93b6613d-ee7f-41f2-bb1b-36bd049da428","module_id":"d4d7a7ff-2205-4fcc-bef4-f935f149d458","created_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:46.299572+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:46.299572+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Verify Ananya’s approved joiner ticket","content":"WHAT WE ARE DOING: Establish authorization BEFORE changing the account for IAM-J-101.\nOPEN: The lab''s fictional HR roster and approval registry, and the service-desk request for Ananya Shah (EMP-1042).\nRUN FROM iam_l1_lab:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe approval_check.py IAM-J-101\nEXPECTED RESULT: DECISION: AUTHORIZED_FOR_L1.\nCHECK: Match employee ID EMP-1042, username ananya.shah, group Finance-Viewers and required manager + application-owner approvals.\nDECISION: If any field or approval does not match, HOLD. Never bypass authorization by editing an approval record.\nUNDERSTAND: A green or urgent ticket label is not sufficient proof of authorization.\n\nSOURCE: Approved IAM L1 v8, source slide(s) 28–29. Module 03 (Explain).","duration":"20","lesson_id":"94ccaa0d-687f-46e8-932b-36856f56672f","module_id":"fc3b345d-ea20-4ef5-8693-9796ed1939b5","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:05.378398+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:05.378398+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Receive the Day 1 joining assignment","content":"WORKPLACE: Aarohan Auto Components - fictional employee onboarding simulation. MODULE FILES: Open the linked guided deck and use the module source and learner workbook from the same Drive course folder.\nDO: Read the HR coordinator role for logging actual arrival, verified identity, access, assets, induction and manager handoff.\n CHECK: Verify candidate ID, evidence, status and responsible owner. Do not mark pending items complete.","duration":"20","lesson_id":"94d9d609-455a-4852-9e51-77b45878cd84","module_id":"022301cb-819a-4972-beb0-ed07f30a1312","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:04.984745+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:04.984745+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Module 07 - Gas Exchange and Cellular Respiration","content":"Follow the approved BODY QUEST slides 82-102 (21 slides). Pause to attempt every question in writing before checking the answer, use feedback, and retry where requested.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"94e0096d-3548-4c9a-a3fb-6f9ebb8446ec","module_id":"4afbc085-1dcc-4eda-88b5-28da435b6f3b","created_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:59.534343+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:59.534343+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"T40 - Read the funnel through Day 2","content":"Work task T40: Read the funnel through Day 2.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nOpen: Daily ad results in the shared offline simulator.\n1. Open Results > Visitor funnel.\n2. Use only Day 1 and Day 2 records.\n3. Enter all four values and check them.\nCompleted example: Clicks: 159; Forms: 23; Started checkout: 9; Paid teams: 1.\nCheck in simulator: 1.\nWhy: A funnel shows where people stop between seeing an ad and paying.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1p5dgB1Wh8E_nYr3b2sRuFnGUaDykfjci/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"20","lesson_id":"954cb46f-4934-428c-9930-7aea5edd8f3a","module_id":"03d4e523-70dc-43cb-bb14-d1028f8d3f49","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:41.19055+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:41.19055+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Collect the verified finance evidence","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Foods - fictional finance workplace case. MODULE FILES: Read the file linked in this lesson. Keep the original source file unchanged.\nDO: Check the linked results from 01_RECON through 06_BENEFITS and the module source evidence before drafting a conclusion.\n CHECK: Save the source-supported output and carry unresolved items to the next task; management approvals are not implied.","duration":"30","lesson_id":"95a95f1c-d56e-4017-bd31-d8cde033b292","module_id":"d61fd402-a087-41e8-bb8c-b4021a36f869","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:07.914033+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:07.914033+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"T08 - Complete a successful test payment","content":"Work task T08: Complete a successful test payment.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nOpen: Website & test checkout in the shared offline simulator.\n1. Select your test form.\n2. Press Success: test payment.\n3. Check its status in the test payment list.\nCompleted example: Mode: TEST ONLY; Amount: ₹750; Payment: captured; Booking: test confirmed.\nCheck in simulator: test confirmed.\nWhy: Test money is not real money, and a test team does not take a real tournament slot.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1tJuOwfbw-QCews6r6YS7DyDeJSIcPkOy/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"20","lesson_id":"95b5320b-85c4-4b89-9282-afb3a6d6abae","module_id":"5ed0a17f-83ab-4746-b1d6-8ab738d6f9eb","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:21.600438+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:21.600438+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Check tracker completeness and open items","content":"WORKPLACE: Aarohan Auto Components - fictional employee onboarding simulation. MODULE FILES: Open the linked guided deck and use the module source and learner workbook from the same Drive course folder.\nDO: Compare every learner tracker entry with the source and slide checkpoints; flag pending status, missing evidence and owners for follow-up.\n CHECK: Verify candidate ID, evidence, status and responsible owner. Do not mark pending items complete.","duration":"35","lesson_id":"95fe566f-51c0-4fc3-b2ef-4a850e6d423c","module_id":"fdb51063-72ec-4a25-a5fe-514c4c631648","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:58.442475+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:58.442475+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"Read the source test observations","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Supermarket - fictional grocery retail BA case. MODULE FILES: Read the file linked in this lesson. Keep the original source file unchanged.\nDO: Inspect T02-T09 scenarios and observed actions; do not invent test execution beyond the supplied case evidence.\n CHECK: Record source-supported evidence; BA recommendations are not system-change approvals.","duration":"30","lesson_id":"963c131d-87f8-4274-9b2f-c83c1d7e01f0","module_id":"3df6a56d-ec9f-466e-a689-aa94bd08320a","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:23.037837+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:23.037837+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Do Along: Group, Predict and Explain","content":"In the simulator, copy each lane choice after the coach, mark the repeating groups, build six complete groups and predict coin 20. Complete the structured mathematical steps; any written explanation is saved for review.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"970d12ed-689b-4fab-be13-5005947a4d2e","module_id":"ac20b2cd-e39d-4173-a04f-67da9ce619c8","created_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:44.475868+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:44.475868+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2}]'::jsonb) r
