SELECT r."title", r."content", r."duration", r."lesson_id", r."module_id", r."created_at", r."updated_at", r."description", r."order_index"
FROM jsonb_populate_recordset(NULL::public."lessons", '[{"title":"S14 - Save a local draft","content":"WHAT: We are storing a suggestion on this device without treating it as verified.\nDO: Use app.js to save the six entered values as an unverified local draft in browser localStorage.\nRUN / RESULT / CHECK: A draft with all six fields, a generated draft ID and draft status is saved locally—not published.\nIF IT FAILS: Check browser localStorage and the console before concluding it saved.\nSOURCE: Linked Module 03 PowerPoint, task S14 (original V25 teaching content).\nEVIDENCE: Grama_Learner_Evidence.xlsx > S01_S43_EXECUTION, row S14.","duration":"45","lesson_id":"c2be5ba9-3288-492e-b404-9482bb2c5980","module_id":"725cf25c-1179-43c1-92b8-a16610df08b7","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:40.891981+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:40.891981+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"CA-002 Step 5 - Run a campaign and decide","content":"Independent challenge CA-002: NEON NIGHT DUOS, a new fictional 2v2 PIXEL RUSH gaming event.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nStarting evidence: 4 paid teams, 8 open places, ₹2,400 maximum ad spend, ₹600 fee per duo. Event date: 30 November 2026.\nOpen: CA-002 in the same offline simulator. Work without copying the CLUTCH ARENA worked answers.\n1. Open each day and read the records\n2. Respond to Day 2 without guessing the cause\n3. See how your decision changes outcomes\nCheck: submit the result in the simulator; correct mistakes using the source records.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nEvidence: save the new-case results and report actual outcomes even if the target is missed.\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1CSnOPP3lw9hO3pH_k7PoG00toEfdGWDv/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"60","lesson_id":"c2f32a09-23b8-477a-bc32-c0b984b516de","module_id":"0a68386e-3c99-4b9d-807f-26b8f5103ed8","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:49.177586+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:49.177586+00:00","description":null,"order_index":5},{"title":"Evolve: Marketing and Sales Analytics","content":"MODULE 4: Marketing and Sales Analytics\n6E STAGE: Evolve\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nBUILD THE MARKETING & SALES POWER BI DASHBOARD\nLoad Mkt_Campaign and Sales_Lead; use Month / Period, Region and Channel / Lead Source dimensions.\nCreate Spend, Leads, Conversions, ROAS, Cost per Conversion, Closed Leads and Win Rate measures.\nAdd ROAS by Channel, Spend vs Conversions, Win Rate and Objection visuals.\nAdd Region and Period slicers.\n\nRESOURCE: M4_Marketing_and_Sales_Evolve.pptx\n\nWORKSHEET TO COMPLETE: MBA_Excel_PowerBI_M4_Evolve_Marketing_Sales_Action_Recommendation.xlsx\n\nCOMPANION WORKSHEET: MBA_Excel_PowerBI_M4_Evolve_Marketing_Sales_Action_Recommendation.xlsx\nWORKSHEET LINK: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1rksevc7ZAxBQLQi0os0ZofPw3b-78Xnd/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=116450298944087782964&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":null,"lesson_id":"c332598e-20a7-4e26-ba20-2d65917f33b2","module_id":"42b2abe9-d25a-4686-8887-58a6810cdd28","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:27.992237+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:27.992237+00:00","description":null,"order_index":5},{"title":"Water Science Fundamentals","content":"Understand why water molecules are polar and how water dissolves substances. Compare solid, liquid and vapour states, and calculate sensible and latent heat. Learn density, viscosity and surface tension through diagrams, formulas, worked examples and an independent question.","duration":"30 minutes","lesson_id":"c3b8c625-b3e3-4862-aa63-2793b4fa5d6f","module_id":"bb63b7ef-edb3-4301-a632-de8c0ba6529c","created_at":"2026-11-17T06:34:18.699111+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:34:18.699111+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Check claim boundaries before proceeding","content":"WORKPLACE: SwaadFit Foods and GrainGlow Foods - fictional packaged snacks marketing cases. MODULE FILES: Open the complete self-paced ZIP; Module 1 presentation, source and learner workbook are inside its 01_Learner_Modules folder.\nDO: Compare with the completed reference only after writing your brief. Mark causes still unproven and save the completed workbook.\n CHECK: Save the working record; open 90_Check_After_Attempt only after completing the task; do not invent approval, actual spending, conversion events or causal claims.","duration":"25","lesson_id":"c5c788ec-35ac-472a-8119-8dc30ef39331","module_id":"29687f58-184a-4af4-a628-043d14f5d175","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:35.783652+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:35.783652+00:00","description":null,"order_index":7},{"title":"S08 - Create structured resource data","content":"WHAT: We are moving resource information into JavaScript objects instead of duplicating it in HTML.\nDO: Define the first structured resource objects in data.js so the cards can be generated from records instead of repeated HTML.\nRUN / RESULT / CHECK: The data.js file contains named fields for two resource records.\nIF IT FAILS: Check script loading order and JavaScript Console for a missing data variable.\nSOURCE: Linked Module 02 PowerPoint, task S08 (original V25 teaching content).\nEVIDENCE: Grama_Learner_Evidence.xlsx > S01_S43_EXECUTION, row S08.","duration":"45","lesson_id":"c9a195b4-2069-499f-be75-e66238af617c","module_id":"7a584fec-8468-485f-aad3-a5fe02e103ca","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:37.204527+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:37.204527+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"T44 - Stop the campaign when places are full","content":"Work task T44: Stop the campaign when places are full.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nOpen: Ads Manager (practice) in the shared offline simulator.\n1. Open Review & publish in Ads Manager.\n2. Press Pause campaign (training).\n3. Check status is Paused.\nCompleted example: Booked teams: 16/16; Required delivery: Paused.\nCheck in simulator: Paused.\nWhy: Do not keep showing ads when the event has no places.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/17IglBQnnnIL9v2w0psRL_Vp2qeuQIzWf/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"20","lesson_id":"ca9df5a9-05c4-4dbd-81da-f46e0951363f","module_id":"216fd3f2-3bed-47da-be6f-5611e637a457","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:43.76057+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:43.76057+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Express: Finance Analytics","content":"MODULE 1: Finance Analytics\n6E STAGE: Express\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nEXPECTED EXCEL DASHBOARD — FINANCE\n\nRESOURCE: M1_Finance_Express.pptx\n\nWORKSHEET TO COMPLETE: MBA_Excel_PowerBI_M1_Express_Finance_KPI_Diagnostic_Insight_Sheet.xlsx\n\nCOMPANION WORKSHEET: MBA_Excel_PowerBI_M1_Express_Finance_KPI_Diagnostic_Insight_Sheet.xlsx\nWORKSHEET LINK: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1Ew3EKpPkI-j0Oq0wzc3JPaz8xXfcfUW2/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=116450298944087782964&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":null,"lesson_id":"cb7d92eb-7da7-479c-9aa9-5871c7ce3c1b","module_id":"a4e8da2a-aba5-4f08-b27c-c417f244968c","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:17.266344+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:17.266344+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"Draw the branching decision record and verify","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Supermarket - fictional grocery retail BA case. MODULE FILES: Record answers in the linked learner workbook. Use the same module source and guided deck from Drive.\nDO: Complete M4_TO_BE_DESIGN!B36:C38, covering different order states; compare with the reference map and record open approvals.\n CHECK: Record source-supported evidence; BA recommendations are not system-change approvals.","duration":"50","lesson_id":"cb95cc3f-48a3-40c6-aeab-0a6938b71c8d","module_id":"4ebcf693-3bd3-4361-805c-aab771f99ee8","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:21.612333+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:21.612333+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"Engage: Course Setup and Lab Readiness","content":"MODULE 0: Course Setup and Lab Readiness\n6E STAGE: Engage\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nNOVARETAIL\nMBA 6-HOUR EXCEL + POWER BI\nBUSINESS ANALYTICS LAB\nFinance\nBusiness Analytics\nHR\nMarketing & Sales\n\nRESOURCE: M0_Course_Setup_Engage.pptx\n\nCOMMON DATASET: Data_Set_Learner_Version.xlsx in Resources, prepared from the uploaded NovaRetail Data Set.xlsx; use relevant dataset sheets for each track.\n\nCOURSE-WIDE MATERIALS:\nExcel and PowerBi.pptx: https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1jXxGin12sSnMG0GtmpF4t4gZMX_wHXAe/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=116450298944087782964&rtpof=true&sd=true\nData Set.xlsx: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1mSpjyZFcxiQipmmUaZzKjrS9g8XXiRa4/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=116450298944087782964&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":null,"lesson_id":"cbd5ce0a-29f8-414b-86ac-763cf96fe999","module_id":"cf79daa7-c6cd-45ae-b28c-77635b6e983b","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:12.250494+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:12.250494+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"T04 - Find the maximum cost per new team","content":"Work task T04: Find the maximum cost per new team.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nOpen: Work order in the shared offline simulator.\n1. Open the Work order calculator.\n2. Keep Budget ₹3,000 and New teams 11.\n3. Press Calculate and enter the result.\nCompleted example: Ad money: ₹3,000; New paid teams needed: 11; Target cost: ₹272.73 each.\nCheck in simulator: ₹272.73 each.\nWhy: This is the most we can spend per added paid team if we want to stay in budget.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1qf78k8RvV7GgG3Rm725jIXzCtZ4LDmes/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"15","lesson_id":"ccb4bb73-cdef-4fac-9fc0-04d88bc32e1f","module_id":"681f39c1-fc77-4026-b85b-29f1521668ef","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:19.044672+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:19.044672+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"S28 - Block unauthorized public writes","content":"WHAT: We are preventing anonymous visitors from approving or altering records.\nDO: Block anonymous record modifications and test unauthorized changes with the provided PowerShell request. Compare all eight database fields before and after.\nRUN / RESULT / CHECK: Unauthorized writes fail; complete database records are unchanged.\nIF IT FAILS: Do not accept a 401/403 status alone as proof: compare the rows.\nSOURCE: Linked Module 05 PowerPoint, task S28 (original V25 teaching content).\nEVIDENCE: Grama_Learner_Evidence.xlsx > S01_S43_EXECUTION, row S28.","duration":"60","lesson_id":"ccb58679-41bb-42e9-96b1-ed41c55984e8","module_id":"cb186bda-f107-4d57-bf65-07aa218b21ef","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:49.429226+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:49.429226+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Financial Close & Management - Guided Learning and Practice","content":"Work through Tasks 43-48 with the module learning deck and operating workbook.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"cd0d33b9-3664-4d2b-8d51-d0074a08b7f2","module_id":"70da0ace-cbb0-4649-92ce-fc44915136c0","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:37:42.729336+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:37:42.729336+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Test your guided second joiner","content":"WHAT WE ARE DOING: Prove Rohit can sign in, view reports and cannot edit them.\nI SHOW — REFERENCE: Observe the paired reference action in the separate reference environment.\nREFERENCE ACTION / COMMAND:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe reference_show.py 19\n# REFERENCE realm only; do NOT run work.py yet.\nI TRY — EXACT REPEAT: Use the same code or clicks shown, unchanged, in your own learner lab. For Python tasks, put the complete code below into the learner work.py file. Do not repeat a state-changing account creation twice in the same realm.\nCODE / EXACT TOOL ACTION:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe check_state.py independent-provision\nRUN / PERFORM:\nPowerShell: execute the checker; also run both portal tests.\nEXPECTED RESULT:\nSTATE CHECK: PASS\nPortal View: 200\nPortal Edit: 403\nCHECK AGAINST THE ACTUAL RESULT:\nNEW private browser login: rohit.nair\nTraining password: RohitLab!2026\nCheck view and edit, then record results.\nIf any test fails, correct and rerun.\nUNDERSTAND:\nAn independent task is complete only when the actual tests pass.\n\nSOURCE: Approved IAM L1 v8, source slide(s) 64–65 (Guided task 19). Module 05 (Empower).","duration":"40","lesson_id":"cd700ab5-249f-48db-a705-5529b53b90ee","module_id":"6d083266-9280-4761-a335-079183e1eb66","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:11.658107+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:11.658107+00:00","description":null,"order_index":6},{"title":"Express: Business Analytics","content":"MODULE 2: Business Analytics\n6E STAGE: Express\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nEXPECTED EXCEL DASHBOARD — BUSINESS ANALYTICS\n\nRESOURCE: M2_Business_Analytics_Express.pptx\n\nWORKSHEET TO COMPLETE: MBA_Excel_PowerBI_M2_Express_Customer_Fulfilment_Diagnostic_Sheet.xlsx\n\nCOMPANION WORKSHEET: MBA_Excel_PowerBI_M2_Express_Customer_Fulfilment_Diagnostic_Sheet.xlsx\nWORKSHEET LINK: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1guoWqgkNP6mwv0V66UV2DqSPuYiMt9Gp/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=116450298944087782964&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":null,"lesson_id":"cd702ede-4b37-419e-8915-e953ad697afc","module_id":"56bcb15d-8908-460a-9eb0-e8fe9461a59c","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:20.665128+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:20.665128+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"CA-002 Step 3 - Test new campaign tracking","content":"Independent challenge CA-002: NEON NIGHT DUOS, a new fictional 2v2 PIXEL RUSH gaming event.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nStarting evidence: 4 paid teams, 8 open places, ₹2,400 maximum ad spend, ₹600 fee per duo. Event date: 30 November 2026.\nOpen: CA-002 in the same offline simulator. Work without copying the CLUTCH ARENA worked answers.\n1. Select the correct new web source\n2. Use Purchase instead of PageView\n3. Test success and failure without real money\nCheck: submit the result in the simulator; correct mistakes using the source records.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nEvidence: save the new-case results and report actual outcomes even if the target is missed.\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1CSnOPP3lw9hO3pH_k7PoG00toEfdGWDv/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"45","lesson_id":"ce1f5f74-d32b-403d-8662-fdf78b4297cb","module_id":"0a68386e-3c99-4b9d-807f-26b8f5103ed8","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:48.043152+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:48.043152+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Record Day 30 status and open issues","content":"WORKPLACE: Aarohan Auto Components - fictional employee onboarding simulation. MODULE FILES: Record answers in the linked learner workbook. Use the same module source and guided deck from Drive.\nDO: Complete 06_Followup_Checkins for Day 30, then update owners and unresolved actions in 07_Issue_Log.\n CHECK: Verify candidate ID, evidence, status and responsible owner. Do not mark pending items complete.","duration":"65","lesson_id":"cf747c54-bff7-4626-a6bd-853f4b158091","module_id":"0e53e3e2-0adb-4d30-b8ff-50c1399923f8","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:12.36106+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:12.36106+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Explain: Business Analytics","content":"MODULE 2: Business Analytics\n6E STAGE: Explain\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nBUSINESS ANALYTICS — ANSWER CHECK\nSouth\nProcess bottleneck — South Jul–Sep\nSouth shows worsening customer outcomes and higher fulfilment delays.\n\nRESOURCE: M2_Business_Analytics_Explain.pptx","duration":null,"lesson_id":"d0461135-a755-4c75-b9e7-9e1db0ee5f6b","module_id":"56bcb15d-8908-460a-9eb0-e8fe9461a59c","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:20.144576+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:20.144576+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Finish: Save Your Pattern Passport","content":"Review the checkpoint results in the simulator. Check whether answers were independent, completed after help or still incomplete. Download or print the full Pattern Passport. Optional written reflections are saved for review, not automatically graded.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"d1380ca6-b3aa-4f07-bf44-9a214a4089c0","module_id":"d761eb0b-f00c-4dd6-9f36-b7f2f65f8f65","created_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:50.43697+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-05T09:47:50.43697+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Grade 9 Geography — River Water","content":"Complete Grade 9 Geography course presentation. Open the linked PowerPoint in resource_url for the full teaching content, examples and activities.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"d182ffdc-1eda-46cb-b385-3376b0832c71","module_id":"fa74ad48-f58b-47fa-b9c7-2d1e0ba979d5","created_at":"2026-11-16T09:14:27.329945+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:14:27.329945+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Inspect approvals, feedback and open issues","content":"WORKPLACE: Aarohan Auto Components - fictional employee onboarding simulation. MODULE FILES: Read the file linked in this lesson. Keep the original source file unchanged.\nDO: Read source dates, approved outcomes and issue evidence for each candidate before recording closure.\n CHECK: Verify candidate ID, evidence, status and responsible owner. Do not mark pending items complete.","duration":"35","lesson_id":"d236e5a3-f577-40e1-8e68-a3d28d220f61","module_id":"77df4865-88d1-4fb4-9b03-948bf7a87499","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:16.893715+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:16.893715+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Read raw WhatsApp-order evidence","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Supermarket - fictional grocery retail BA case. MODULE FILES: Read the file linked in this lesson. Keep the original source file unchanged.\nDO: Inspect the 200 order records and locate Order ID, store, confirmation time, stock-update time, cancelled items and status without modifying source rows.\n CHECK: Record source-supported evidence; BA recommendations are not system-change approvals.","duration":"30","lesson_id":"d4740641-3597-4b70-8083-c8d18f9c15d7","module_id":"9184ac19-93a3-42ea-90f1-0de8006dab18","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:11.612499+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:11.612499+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Create setup requests and Day 1 status","content":"WORKPLACE: Aarohan Auto Components - fictional employee onboarding simulation. MODULE FILES: Record answers in the linked learner workbook. Use the same module source and guided deck from Drive.\nDO: Complete 11_Transfer_Setup and 12_Transfer_Day1; identify critical blockers and distinguish requested versus fulfilled access.\n CHECK: Verify candidate ID, evidence, status and responsible owner. Do not mark pending items complete.","duration":"65","lesson_id":"d4911e86-0d77-43ba-99dd-430b9aa77a6c","module_id":"1a9397ae-439a-4b11-a6a7-a53ccaa97535","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:21.157259+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:21.157259+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"Inspect channel costs, minimums and roles","content":"WORKPLACE: SwaadFit Foods and GrainGlow Foods - fictional packaged snacks marketing cases. MODULE FILES: Read the file linked in this lesson. Keep the original source file unchanged.\nDO: Read SwaadFit_M3_Source.xlsx channel costs, protected minimums, revised constraints and execution details before allocating the plan.\n CHECK: Save the working record; open 90_Check_After_Attempt only after completing the task; do not invent approval, actual spending, conversion events or causal claims.","duration":"30","lesson_id":"d4ae606c-2928-49e9-8fb0-7b10b5c8d820","module_id":"7f78ef5d-704e-4360-9363-d268dc2a086e","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:40.887996+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:40.887996+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2}]'::jsonb) r
