FROM jsonb_populate_recordset(NULL::public."lessons", '[{"title":"Write the finance manager review","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Foods - fictional finance workplace case. MODULE FILES: Record answers in the linked learner workbook. Use the same module source and guided deck from Drive.\nDO: Complete learner sheet 07_MANAGER_REVIEW with September revenue, P&L gap, working-capital risk, annual forecast and October follow-up; leave approval to manager.\n CHECK: Save the source-supported output and carry unresolved items to the next task; management approvals are not implied.","duration":"70","lesson_id":"d57d626a-03b6-4f3e-8579-75a749a29fad","module_id":"d61fd402-a087-41e8-bb8c-b4021a36f869","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:08.481828+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:08.481828+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Check and hand over verified September sales","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Foods - fictional finance workplace case. MODULE FILES: Open the linked guided deck and use the module source and learner workbook from the same Drive course folder.\nDO: Use the deck check slides to verify the adjusted amount and zero GL difference; save the two completed learner tabs and escalate any unsupported correction.\n CHECK: Save the source-supported output and carry unresolved items to the next task; management approvals are not implied.","duration":"30","lesson_id":"d5a932d0-90bc-45e0-8e0c-8cbef31af28b","module_id":"256300bc-d9a5-4ac7-b553-8db9932a5b71","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:53.436875+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:53.436875+00:00","description":null,"order_index":5},{"title":"Grade 10 Economics — River Water","content":"Complete Grade 10 Economics course presentation. Open the linked PowerPoint in resource_url for the full teaching content, examples and activities.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"d5d43f02-92cc-4e69-baaa-9cd90a01b1bd","module_id":"a4a7522c-ce2a-4b88-b42a-b754766e648d","created_at":"2026-11-16T09:14:34.311755+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:14:34.311755+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"CA-002 Step 4 - Configure the new draft","content":"Independent challenge CA-002: NEON NIGHT DUOS, a new fictional 2v2 PIXEL RUSH gaming event.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nStarting evidence: 4 paid teams, 8 open places, ₹2,400 maximum ad spend, ₹600 fee per duo. Event date: 30 November 2026.\nOpen: CA-002 in the same offline simulator. Work without copying the CLUTCH ARENA worked answers.\n1. Set Sales, the new campaign name and lifetime budget\n2. Choose dates and approved placements\n3. Save a new draft, not a live campaign\nCheck: submit the result in the simulator; correct mistakes using the source records.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nEvidence: save the new-case results and report actual outcomes even if the target is missed.\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1CSnOPP3lw9hO3pH_k7PoG00toEfdGWDv/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"50","lesson_id":"d685299a-1e74-446c-a0ca-c9e33698a90f","module_id":"0a68386e-3c99-4b9d-807f-26b8f5103ed8","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:48.610732+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:48.610732+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"T29 - Set the six-day schedule","content":"Work task T29: Set the six-day schedule.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nOpen: Ads Manager (practice) in the shared offline simulator.\n1. In the Ad set tab enter the start and end.\n2. Use the shown India time values.\n3. Save the ad set.\nCompleted example: Start: 20 Oct 2026, 09:00; End: 26 Oct 2026, 09:00.\nCheck in simulator: 26 Oct 2026, 09:00.\nWhy: Ads should not run after registration closes.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (not yet uploaded to Drive): Module_05_Build_the_Ad_Campaign/M05_Build_the_Ad_Campaign.pptx\nLMS ADMIN ACTION: Upload this module deck separately before learner publication.","duration":"20","lesson_id":"d6a51d90-d2a1-4df1-8994-935f6e52eb6d","module_id":"5e0d6e1b-e6fa-450d-93da-45fb48e4bcb7","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:34.388857+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:34.388857+00:00","description":null,"order_index":5},{"title":"Explain: Final Submission and Oral Defence","content":"MODULE 5: Final Submission and Oral Defence\n6E STAGE: Explain\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nFINAL SUBMISSION SUMMARY\nProblem\n5 Findings\n3 Actions\nLimitation\n\nRESOURCE: M5_Final_Submission_Explain.pptx","duration":null,"lesson_id":"d9d740e3-7b4e-4dfa-9e0f-30b7fe93e57f","module_id":"b7fb8dde-5329-4c61-8197-4f52cdf3ccac","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:30.352543+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:30.352543+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"S22 - Serve the same Grama frontend","content":"WHAT: We are displaying our own S19 web page through Express instead of Python.\nDO: Configure Express to serve the original Grama client at localhost:3000. Import the S19 backup into this new browser origin.\nRUN / RESULT / CHECK: The same frontend loads through Express; the imported local draft retains its ORIGINAL D-ID.\nIF IT FAILS: Browser storage does not transfer between ports automatically: reimport and verify the ID.\nSOURCE: Linked Module 04 PowerPoint, task S22 (original V25 teaching content).\nEVIDENCE: Grama_Learner_Evidence.xlsx > S01_S43_EXECUTION, row S22.","duration":"45","lesson_id":"da6f8e9b-9045-43f8-89a0-a23c884c358d","module_id":"8009900c-e018-4848-aab2-f1e19136e26a","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:45.72771+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:45.72771+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Fix Mira’s missing permission","content":"WHAT WE ARE DOING: Ticket IAM-R-102 approves Finance-Viewers. Add it to Mira’s EXISTING account.\nI SHOW — REFERENCE: Observe the paired reference action in the separate reference environment.\nREFERENCE ACTION / COMMAND:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe reference_show.py 13\n# REFERENCE realm only; do NOT run work.py yet.\nI TRY — EXACT REPEAT: Use the same code or clicks shown, unchanged, in your own learner lab. For Python tasks, put the complete code below into the learner work.py file. Do not repeat a state-changing account creation twice in the same realm.\nCODE / EXACT TOOL ACTION:\nfrom iam_api import connect, find_user, find_group, group_names, ROOT\ns = connect(\"IAM-R-102\")\nu = find_user(s, \"mira.khan\")\ng = find_group(s, \"Finance-Viewers\")\nr = s.put(f\"{ROOT}/users/{u[''id'']}/groups/{g[''id'']}\",\n          timeout=15)\nr.raise_for_status()\nprint(\"AFTER:\", group_names(s, u[\"id\"]))\nRUN / PERFORM:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe work.py\nEXPECTED RESULT:\nAFTER: [''Finance-Viewers'']\nCHECK AGAINST THE ACTUAL RESULT:\nVerify the original mira.khan user was modified.\nFinance-Editors must remain absent.\nIf the group is wrong, stop and correct.\nUNDERSTAND:\nRepair an authorized entitlement; do not create another identity.\n\nSOURCE: Approved IAM L1 v8, source slide(s) 50–51 (Guided task 13). Module 04 (Express).","duration":"40","lesson_id":"da7d4974-52c5-4f2a-9b24-a13f8ebd58c4","module_id":"9226bb2b-cd3e-4f73-82c1-66c0e5320bd7","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:09.102802+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:09.102802+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Grade 11 Sociology — Water, inequality and social institutions","content":"Complete Grade 11 Sociology course presentation. Open the linked PowerPoint in resource_url for the full teaching content, examples and activities.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"daccbe35-8198-4f5d-b570-49945f077c6d","module_id":"91520bfb-bcd9-4e33-b732-7b1aeacd9d86","created_at":"2026-11-16T09:14:53.616349+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:14:53.616349+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"T21 - Find a Purchase linked to a captured payment","content":"Work task T21: Find a Purchase linked to a captured payment.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nOpen: Tracking lab in the shared offline simulator.\n1. Open TEST checkout and confirm your successful payment exists.\n2. Open Tracking lab and inspect the Purchase already made by that payment.\n3. Press Check captured Purchase. This check must not create another Purchase.\nCompleted example: Required payment: captured; Event value: 750 INR; Rule: Never create Purchase from a button alone.\nCheck in simulator: Never create Purchase from a button alone.\nWhy: A Purchase is real only when matched to the payment evidence.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1XAIeg9OHnwXONsTjITRLTCOmoFZ4ZXi8/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"25","lesson_id":"dad90e97-92fd-4440-818c-2f0f6593bba9","module_id":"8f675f68-d87b-40ab-aeff-7026a8b062ac","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:29.556861+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:29.556861+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"T12 - Mark the website ready","content":"Work task T12: Mark the website ready.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nOpen: Website & test checkout in the shared offline simulator.\n1. Read the website QA checklist.\n2. Press Website ready after tests pass.\n3. If something failed, do not mark ready.\nCompleted example: Form: PASS; Payment success/fail: PASS; No double count: PASS; No overselling: PASS.\nCheck in simulator: PASS.\nWhy: We should fix broken steps before buying advertisements.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1tJuOwfbw-QCews6r6YS7DyDeJSIcPkOy/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"15","lesson_id":"db634e82-89fa-4399-b1ec-d5f687169b86","module_id":"5ed0a17f-83ab-4746-b1d6-8ab738d6f9eb","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:23.868681+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:23.868681+00:00","description":null,"order_index":7},{"title":"Trace the motor, sensor, controller and warning lamp","content":"SEE the sensor fixed on the motor housing. It reports the motor housing temperature (not room temperature). The controller reads the sample, checks the warning rule and shows a lamp for the operator. OUTPUT: identify where each temperature reading comes from and why the warning matters.","duration":"20","lesson_id":"db9d64be-f008-4e6e-a9bb-1fbe14fae34a","module_id":"e05a5029-3776-445a-bdf7-209387c8eb3c","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:23.277563+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:23.277563+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Prove Mira’s problem is fixed","content":"WHAT WE ARE DOING: Run the saved-state checker and repeat the view/deny browser test.\nI SHOW — REFERENCE: Observe the paired reference action in the separate reference environment.\nREFERENCE ACTION / COMMAND:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe reference_show.py 14\n# REFERENCE realm only; do NOT run work.py yet.\nI TRY — EXACT REPEAT: Use the same code or clicks shown, unchanged, in your own learner lab. For Python tasks, put the complete code below into the learner work.py file. Do not repeat a state-changing account creation twice in the same realm.\nCODE / EXACT TOOL ACTION:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe check_state.py repair-provision\nRUN / PERFORM:\nPowerShell: run the checker, then test both portal actions.\nEXPECTED RESULT:\nSTATE CHECK: PASS\nMira view -> 200 | Report visible\nMira edit -> 403 | Access denied\nCHECK AGAINST THE ACTUAL RESULT:\nUse a NEW private browser login as mira.khan.\nCheck both portal results after the repair.\nRecord BEFORE 403 and AFTER 200/403.\nUNDERSTAND:\nA repair is valid only when the observed behavior changes as expected.\n\nSOURCE: Approved IAM L1 v8, source slide(s) 52–53 (Guided task 14). Module 04 (Express).","duration":"45","lesson_id":"dba1756a-64c5-4eb9-8f76-56ebf6834d51","module_id":"9226bb2b-cd3e-4f73-82c1-66c0e5320bd7","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:09.386496+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:09.386496+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"S01 - Create the Grama page","content":"WHAT: We are creating the first website for a community resource desk.\nDO: Create Grama/index.html and the placeholder styles.css, data.js, app.js and sw.js in the existing empty Grama/ folder. Use the supplied Windows launcher or run py -m http.server 8765; keep that terminal open and browse separately in Chrome.\nRUN / RESULT / CHECK: The first page loads on localhost:8765 without missing-file errors.\nIF IT FAILS: Check the five exact filenames in VS Code if Chrome shows 404.\nSOURCE: Linked Module 01 PowerPoint, task S01 (original V25 teaching content).\nEVIDENCE: Grama_Learner_Evidence.xlsx > S01_S43_EXECUTION, row S01.\nWORKBOOK: https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1XAjORw1veJKQhvdUaAIIhq9yI9xbkq7-/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"45","lesson_id":"de868991-4a14-45c0-8a2f-e5be9f43b3e5","module_id":"94232a37-0467-4fbc-bb04-b11c3a6b98ab","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:32.942676+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:48:32.942676+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Complete probation status with authorized evidence","content":"WORKPLACE: Aarohan Auto Components - fictional employee onboarding simulation. MODULE FILES: Record answers in the linked learner workbook. Use the same module source and guided deck from Drive.\nDO: Update 08_Probation_Closure with manager feedback, approved outcome, approver, decision/effective date and communication state.\n CHECK: Verify candidate ID, evidence, status and responsible owner. Do not mark pending items complete.","duration":"65","lesson_id":"e0d92c88-d9da-467f-8e8b-8dd9d61fb762","module_id":"77df4865-88d1-4fb4-9b03-948bf7a87499","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:17.460137+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:51:17.460137+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Explore: HR Analytics","content":"MODULE 3: HR Analytics\n6E STAGE: Explore\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nHR EXCEL FORMULAS\nExit Rate\nExits / Opening_Headcount\nOT per Employee\nOvertime_Hours / Opening_Headcount\nAbsence per Employee\nAbsence_Days / Opening_Headcount\nOffer Acceptance Rate\nAccepted Offers /\n(Accepted Offers + Declined Offers)\nJoining Rate\nJoined Candidates / Accepted Offers\n30-Day Check Rate\nCompleted 30-Day Checks /\nEligible New Joiners\n\nRESOURCE: M3_HR_Explore.pptx","duration":null,"lesson_id":"e0efe42d-4206-4f8c-9b43-c760e2316144","module_id":"8759a2fe-d783-4917-9716-d5383a2387ac","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:23.013663+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:23.013663+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Revoke Rohit in guided practice","content":"WHAT WE ARE DOING: Approved leaver ticket IAM-L-401: remove Rohit’s group and disable his account.\nI SHOW — REFERENCE: Observe the paired reference action in the separate reference environment.\nREFERENCE ACTION / COMMAND:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe reference_show.py 24\n# REFERENCE realm only; do NOT run work.py yet.\nI TRY — EXACT REPEAT: Use the same code or clicks shown, unchanged, in your own learner lab. For Python tasks, put the complete code below into the learner work.py file. Do not repeat a state-changing account creation twice in the same realm.\nCODE / EXACT TOOL ACTION:\nfrom iam_api import connect, find_user, find_group, group_names, ROOT\ns = connect(\"IAM-L-401\")\nu = find_user(s, \"rohit.nair\")\ng = find_group(s, \"Finance-Viewers\")\nr = s.delete(f\"{ROOT}/users/{u[''id'']}/groups/{g[''id'']}\",\n             timeout=15)\nr.raise_for_status()\nr = s.put(f\"{ROOT}/users/{u[''id'']}\",\n          json={**u, \"enabled\": False}, timeout=15)\nr.raise_for_status()\nprint(\"ENABLED:\", find_user(s, \"rohit.nair\")[\"enabled\"])\nprint(\"GROUPS:\", group_names(s, u[\"id\"]))\nRUN / PERFORM:\n.\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe work.py\nEXPECTED RESULT:\nENABLED: False\nGROUPS: []\nCHECK AGAINST THE ACTUAL RESULT:\nOnly the correct Rohit identity was changed.\nNo group remains and Enabled is OFF.\nIf either fails, correct and test again.\nUNDERSTAND:\nThe same lifecycle works from joiner through authorized leaver.\n\nSOURCE: Approved IAM L1 v8, source slide(s) 79–80 (Guided task 24). Module 06 (Evolve).","duration":"50","lesson_id":"e12035d8-e044-459c-9a62-233c2771556c","module_id":"08ce89f2-829a-4f61-8004-4bb83c2c6ff7","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:14.494819+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:14.494819+00:00","description":null,"order_index":5},{"title":"Inspect current-process evidence","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Supermarket - fictional grocery retail BA case. MODULE FILES: Read the file linked in this lesson. Keep the original source file unchanged.\nDO: Read each P1-P6 source card in the data pack before deciding the order and the location of the breakdown.\n CHECK: Record source-supported evidence; BA recommendations are not system-change approvals.","duration":"30","lesson_id":"e29216f5-b90c-4ce9-8dfa-02ecbec7b48a","module_id":"00a3db8f-40b2-4d86-9c83-62c4bcc12ef3","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:15.314993+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:15.314993+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2},{"title":"Read the process acceptance and pilot-ready rules","content":"WORKPLACE: Sri Lakshmi Supermarket - fictional grocery retail BA case. MODULE FILES: Open the linked guided deck and use the module source and learner workbook from the same Drive course folder.\nDO: Understand the expected-versus-observed validation approach and the worked T04 failed case.\n CHECK: Record source-supported evidence; BA recommendations are not system-change approvals.","duration":"20","lesson_id":"e2aec257-015c-404b-9e9a-a6056e4a2184","module_id":"3df6a56d-ec9f-466e-a689-aa94bd08320a","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:22.472685+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:22.472685+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Empower: Final Submission and Oral Defence","content":"MODULE 5: Final Submission and Oral Defence\n6E STAGE: Empower\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nFINAL SELF-CHECK BEFORE SUBMISSION\nCleaning done\nFormulas correct\nPivotTables done\nPower BI complete\n5 findings\n3 actions\n\nRESOURCE: M5_Final_Submission_Empower.pptx","duration":null,"lesson_id":"e44d473c-2802-4045-93f9-e902b2560429","module_id":"b7fb8dde-5329-4c61-8197-4f52cdf3ccac","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:31.915252+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:31.915252+00:00","description":null,"order_index":6},{"title":"Connect the visual group change to Python","content":"WHAT WE ARE DOING: See that a UI operation and the IAM API operation can implement the same approved group membership.\nI SHOW / UI: Users → find ananya.shah → Groups → Join Group → select Finance-Viewers → confirm membership.\nCODE / API (demonstration only):\nfrom iam_api import connect, find_user, find_group, ROOT\ns=connect(\"IAM-J-101\")\nu=find_user(s,\"ananya.shah\")\ng=find_group(s,\"Finance-Viewers\")\nr=s.put(f\"{ROOT}/users/{u[''id'']}/groups/{g[''id'']}\",timeout=15)\nr.raise_for_status()\nEXPECTED RESULT: The correct employee belongs to Finance-Viewers, not Finance-Editors.\nCHECK: Application-level View 200 and Edit 403 tests are still necessary.\nUNDERSTAND: The API performs a group change, but a successful API response alone does not prove usable and correctly limited application access.\n\nSOURCE: Approved IAM L1 v8, source slide(s) 13. Module 01 (Engage).\nREVISIT SIMULATOR: Open the same offline IAM First Shift HTML from this lesson resource. Find the group assignment and the permitted/denied report results you just reproduced. Compare those actions with the shown Python/API operations; do not invent a different case. Google Drive provides the file download, not a live hosted simulator.","duration":"45","lesson_id":"e50b1245-365b-4e87-8bb5-aa8e6cb36f3b","module_id":"e3fe24fa-601b-4db2-8e4a-d03421c93044","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:02.24417+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:02.24417+00:00","description":null,"order_index":4},{"title":"Grade 8 English — River Water","content":"Complete Grade 8 English course presentation. Open the linked PowerPoint in resource_url for the full teaching content, examples and activities.","duration":null,"lesson_id":"e5c6eee8-157c-492c-b957-32c0a18b3301","module_id":"fb31cf5c-16c9-408a-b529-973eb650fb50","created_at":"2026-11-16T09:14:20.368439+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-16T09:14:20.368439+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Aquatic Ecology and Nutrient Cycles","content":"Follow energy through an aquatic food web. Explain how nitrogen and phosphorus move through water and how extra nutrients may affect algal growth. Use a dissolved-oxygen model to see oxygen depletion and recovery. Distinguish measured results from possible causes.","duration":"30 minutes","lesson_id":"e5cf3021-dfe6-498a-b3a8-1f3ee565ae36","module_id":"2099de7b-333c-4b46-8817-3a30ca4e5566","created_at":"2026-11-17T06:34:30.614343+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:34:30.614343+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"T06 - Check the player website","content":"Work task T06: Check the player website.\nPRACTICE FILE - INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR: Use the linked resource in this lesson. Download the HTML file from Google Drive, then open it in Chrome or Edge; the Drive preview does not run the simulator. Keep the same file and browser for all modules.\nOpen: Website & test checkout in the shared offline simulator.\n1. Open Website & test checkout. Choose Mobile view.\n2. Read the fee, age rule, city and event date. Press Page details checked.\n3. Press Register team. You must see the registration form open.\nCompleted example: Screen: Website → Mobile → Register team; Fee: ₹750/team; Eligibility: 18+; Result: Five-player form opens.\nCheck in simulator: Five-player form opens.\nWhy: A wrong price or missing rule can make players leave the page.\nSimulator file: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1gI5LWjKJZAE-__OzQo1vqFr1s6oHmOgu/view?usp=drivesdk\nMODULE SLIDES (PowerPoint): https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1tJuOwfbw-QCews6r6YS7DyDeJSIcPkOy/edit?usp=drivesdk&ouid=117748485795287437293&rtpof=true&sd=true","duration":"20","lesson_id":"e5f741ed-deee-4430-b9c4-3d114c9779c4","module_id":"5ed0a17f-83ab-4746-b1d6-8ab738d6f9eb","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:20.461851+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:49:20.461851+00:00","description":null,"order_index":1},{"title":"Empower: Business Analytics","content":"MODULE 2: Business Analytics\n6E STAGE: Empower\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nBUILD THE BUSINESS ANALYTICS POWER BI DASHBOARD\nLoad BA_Order and BA_Process.\nUse Month and Region dimensions.\nCreate Orders, AOV, Delivery Days, Return Rate, Complaint Rate, Satisfaction and Delay measures.\nAdd KPI cards.\nAdd Delivery by Region, Return / Complaint trend and Delay by Stage.\nAdd Month, Region and Sales Channel slicers.\n\nRESOURCE: M2_Business_Analytics_Empower.pptx","duration":null,"lesson_id":"e6d6bfb2-4287-457c-9876-b237e4180975","module_id":"56bcb15d-8908-460a-9eb0-e8fe9461a59c","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:21.703393+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:21.703393+00:00","description":null,"order_index":6},{"title":"Build the main onboarding tracker","content":"WORKPLACE: Aarohan Auto Components - fictional employee onboarding simulation. MODULE FILES: Record answers in the linked learner workbook. Use the same module source and guided deck from Drive.\nDO: In learner 02_Onboarding_Tracker create the candidate register and source-backed joining controls; preserve candidate IDs and do not infer missing approvals.\n CHECK: Verify candidate ID, evidence, status and responsible owner. Do not mark pending items complete.","duration":"55","lesson_id":"e76b3d11-8f3a-48f7-ab6a-e1d8077c23c2","module_id":"fdb51063-72ec-4a25-a5fe-514c4c631648","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:57.877498+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:50:57.877498+00:00","description":null,"order_index":3},{"title":"Explore: Final Submission and Oral Defence","content":"MODULE 5: Final Submission and Oral Defence\n6E STAGE: Explore\nSOURCE SLIDE CONTENT:\nFINAL SUBMISSION SUMMARY\nProblem\n5 Findings\n3 Actions\nLimitation\n\nRESOURCE: M5_Final_Submission_Explore.pptx","duration":null,"lesson_id":"e7cf2fb6-e910-46f0-ad4c-ab992f6d2f57","module_id":"b7fb8dde-5329-4c61-8197-4f52cdf3ccac","created_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:29.828866+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-06T08:40:29.828866+00:00","description":null,"order_index":2}]'::jsonb) r
